hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"531","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib se, hamare ek shaykh se, unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas koi pasandida muamla aata to Aap farmate: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jo Nemat dene wala Fazl karne wala hai, jis ki nematon se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain, aur jab Aap ke paas koi napasandida muamla aata to farmate: Har haal me tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se riwayat ki gayi hai, aur is me zaeef ahadees hain, aur ye sahih nahi hai."
